{
  "job_B9.6.6_20251003_115103": {
    "chunk_text": "um, bi \u00fe\u00e6m we beforan s\u00e6gdon; Adrianus ferde \u00e6rest to Emme Senonum & \u00e6fter \u00feam to Pharaonem M\u00e6lda biscopum, & longe For\u00feon hy nedde se towearda winter, \u00fe\u00e6t heo stille wunedon, swa hw\u00e6r swa heo meahten. \u00dea \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fea cu\u00f0e \u00e6rendwrecan s\u00e6gdon Ecgberhte \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge, \u00fe\u00e6tte se biscop w\u00e6re in Froncna \u00dea he \u00fea \u00feider cwom, \u00fea nom he Theodor biscop mid Ebrinus leafnesse \u00fe\u00e6s ealdormonnes, & \u00de\u00e6r hine gestod sumu untrymnis, & he \u00fe\u00e6r f\u00e6c gewunade; & sona swa he trumian ongon, swa Ebrinus se ealdormon genom Adrianum \u00feone abbud & on f\u00e6stene h\u00e6fde, for\u00feon he resade, \u00fe\u00e6t Ac \u00fea he \u00fea so\u00f0lice onget & onfand, \u00fe\u00e6t hit swa ne w\u00e6s, swa he resade, \u00fea onlesde he hine & let Ond sona \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he to him cwom, \u00fea sealde he him Sancte Petres mynster, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6ra For\u00feon se apostolica papa bebead Theodore biscope, \u00fea he from him ferde, \u00fe\u00e6t he him on his \u00dea cwom he Theodor biscop to his cirican in Contwara burg \u00fey \u00e6fteran geare halgunge \u00f0y syxtan & he lifde on biscophade aan & twentig wintra & \u00fereo mona\u00f0 & syx & twentig daga. Ond he sona \u00f0urhferde eall Breotone ealond, swa hwyder ymb swa Ongol\u00feeode drohtedon & Ond he rehte endebyrdnesse lifes \u00e6teawde, & rihte Eastran to weor\u00f0ianne l\u00e6rde. Ond",
